@startuml rating-flow
!include common.iuml
title Rating flow, human games

participant "game completion\none transaction writes the game row\nand its stat lines" as done
participant "rating law" as law
database "rating_events" as events
participant "aggregates\nper-variant latest rating, per-variant series won,\nWLD totals" as agg
participant "surfaces\nprofile hero and history, home per-variant\nstat lines, playback rating deltas" as surfaces

done -> done : Both seats human? No: a bot seat writes\nno rating event, bot games stay outside the ladder
alt decisive outcome
  done -> law : Read both current ratings,\nlatest rating_after, RatingStart default
  law -> law : K = 10 ^ ((loser - winner) / D),\nD = full divisor on an upset,\nelse the decay band over the loser's rating
  law -> events : Write 2 rows, winner gains and loser loses\nthe same rounded delta, delta and rating_after per player
else draw
  done -> done : The rating moves nothing
end
events -> agg : Aggregates read the same rows
agg -> surfaces
@enduml
